{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の目黒陽色（めぐろひいろ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍜6月21日　昨日のオンラインミーグリありがとうございました♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobCqdmS2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっとだけチャイナ♪な黒お洋服でした🖤\nナルトがすき🍥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moby7D1tz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🥟🤏🏻ほっぺが餃子みたいって❔。。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobvR4wTQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すてきな白のロングスカート🤍🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎀最近、田村さんが四期生にと、お洋服をくださいました。\n本当に嬉しすぎて、早速着させていただいています❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宝物です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobr4cVz3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "😚6月14日　オンラインミーグリありがとうございました❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobtbBJQF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobB9ake2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はゆるっとカジュアルなコーデだったよ〜😙♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングルオンラインミーグリが始まって、\nいつも来てくださる皆さんに加えて\n初めましてで来てくださる皆さんが増えているように感じて、心から嬉しいです❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も、\n四期生ライブの感想を伝えてくださったり、\nサクコイカレシイベントのことや、うさぎ島へ行ったYouTube動画のお話、普段のトークやレターのお話など。\n他にも沢山嬉しい言葉で伝えてくださって、ずっと幸せな時間だったな〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お話しすることが大好き、ミーグリ大好き！\nな私なので、ぜひぜひ気になってくださってる方\nいつでもお待ちしてます〜♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⭐️\nなんと、\n今日は初めましてのブログから丁度一年の記念日ということで。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりに見返したら、ブログの一枚目の写真はなんとも言えない表情でした☺︎\n少し自撮りが上手くなったかな。。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、いつも応援してくださる皆さん、本当にありがとうございます❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもどうぞよろしくお願いします🙇‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はここまで⭐︎"}], "source": "official"}